At the local gunshow this weekend I saw several inexpensive .380 Autos.

The Lorcin was larger than I remembered (I was thinking of the .22 model) and
had a rather small safety that I didn't like. My Girlyfriend didn't like the 
somewhat oversized feel of the grip.

