accessible safety, as well as being black. I got this for her.

All of the mentioned guns are single action, 6 rounds (A-Tec may be less) and  
were selling for just under $100 dollars. When we try out the Jennings with    
various ammo I can update anyone interested.

I didn't see any .380 Grendels but did see the .22 mag the company also makes.
It's not a small gun but holds something like 20 or 30 rounds. Surprisingly
